    {
      "id": "kpsH4dzEVARx3X2S8qqr8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 745.6703099164956,
      "y": 8776.086002405109,
      "width": 827.0193481445312,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bCEV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 966601514,
      "version": 133,
      "versionNonce": 478080630,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787915898731,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1- Client to API Route: The CodeMirror 6 editor sends a POST request \ncontaining the selectedCode, fullCode, and user instruction to the backend endpoint.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1- Client to API Route: The CodeMirror 6 editor sends a POST request \ncontaining the selectedCode, fullCode, and user instruction to the backend endpoint.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "KTZA_XHaqUtw2A4Lh4Ix8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 743.003633077303,
      "y": 8869.086007491373,
      "width": 776.6194458007812,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bCEl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1807444330,
      "version": 163,
      "versionNonce": 235383670,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787915926874,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2- Authentication Check: The API route verifies the user's session using Clerk.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2- Authentication Check: The API route verifies the user's session using Clerk.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "hTNcBjnCO-sAWnY9ya-bV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 737.6702793989176,
      "y": 9110.0860176639,
      "width": 874.1193237304688,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bCEp",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1212733546,
      "version": 352,
      "versionNonce": 1871750954,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787917417935,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4- URL Scraping: Any documentation links found within the user's instruction are scraped \nin parallel via Firecrawl and converted into clean markdown content.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4- URL Scraping: Any documentation links found within the user's instruction are scraped \nin parallel via Firecrawl and converted into clean markdown content.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "AXNd1UAjMd5B9GNz4-ZRe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 739.003643249829,
      "y": 9220.419320479654,
      "width": 968.37939453125,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bCEr",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1590757162,
      "version": 353,
      "versionNonce": 2070694890,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787916026232,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5- Prompt Assembly & AI Execution: The API combines the code context, scraped documentation, \nand instruction into the prompt template, then queries Claude AI, enforcing a strict JSON output \nstructure via the Zod schema (quickEditAISchema).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5- Prompt Assembly & AI Execution: The API combines the code context, scraped documentation, \nand instruction into the prompt template, then queries Claude AI, enforcing a strict JSON output \nstructure via the Zod schema (quickEditAISchema).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "7FR83ZWHN5ZePGES8MmZ1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 756.3371189985268,
      "y": 9621.419406946123,
      "width": 696.5196533203125,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bCErV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1263801654,
      "version": 465,
      "versionNonce": 1030767466,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787918186160,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1- Payload Validation: The fetcher function takes the request payload \nand validates it using QuickEditRequestSchema.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1- Payload Validation: The fetcher function takes the request payload \nand validates it using QuickEditRequestSchema.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "eJ5A-pEIQj0uDhIQo03y3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 759.0038467003496,
      "y": 9714.419412032386,
      "width": 1069.119384765625,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bCErl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1007028598,
      "version": 495,
      "versionNonce": 159060662,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787918195522,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2- HTTP Request: It sends a POST request to the backend route using ky with a timeout and abort signal.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2- HTTP Request: It sends a POST request to the backend route using ky with a timeout and abort signal.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "GcKubpdVQ9TBPZAIUXSv2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 759.337210551261,
      "y": 9782.752745365719,
      "width": 983.4593505859375,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
